        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Taikou Risshiden III is an adventure strategy game set in medieval Japan, following characters connected to the rise of Toyotomi Hideyoshi. Players travel between towns, interact with historical figures, manage money and resources, and make choices that shape their progress through the story.\n\nThe game features two playable protagonists, first- and third-person perspectives, and a faction system that allows players to experience different paths through the Sengoku period",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Taikou Risshiden III es un juego de estrategia y aventura ambientado en el Japón medieval, que sigue a personajes vinculados al ascenso de Toyotomi Hideyoshi. Los jugadores viajan entre ciudades, interactúan con figuras históricas, administran dinero y recursos, y toman decisiones que moldean su avance en la historia.\n\nEl juego cuenta con dos protagonistas jugables, perspectivas en primera y tercera persona, y un sistema de facciones que permite vivir distintos caminos a través del período Sengoku.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1999",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
